    <title>3-代码源C队模拟赛2026-8-2赛后总结</title>
    <url>/2026/08/02/3-%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%BA%90C%E9%98%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E8%B5%9B2026-8-2%E8%B5%9B%E5%90%8E%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="2026-8-2代码源C队模拟赛-3赛后总结"><a href="#2026-8-2代码源C队模拟赛-3赛后总结" class="headerlink" title="2026-8-2代码源C队模拟赛-3赛后总结"></a>2026-8-2代码源C队模拟赛-3赛后总结</h1><p><del><em>别问我标题为什么是C队模拟赛-3</em></del>  </p>
<h2 id="比赛概述-难点分析："><a href="#比赛概述-难点分析：" class="headerlink" title="比赛概述+难点分析："></a>比赛概述+难点分析：</h2><ol>
<li>本场比赛共4道题,时长共4小时。</li>
<li>比赛为OI赛制（比赛中看不到分数和排名）</li>
<li>T1,T3较简单,</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="题目分析"><a href="#题目分析" class="headerlink" title="题目分析"></a>题目分析</h2><h3 id="T1-双面编号牌"><a href="#T1-双面编号牌" class="headerlink" title="T1 双面编号牌"></a>T1 双面编号牌</h3><p><a href="https://newoj.daimayuan.top/p/5298?tid=6a6dd8a13beb8b91ff8fd43b">原题链接</a><br>分析：<br>题目条件：  </p>
<ol>
<li><em>1&lt;&#x3D;a&lt;&#x3D;n;</em></li>
<li><em>1&lt;&#x3D;b&lt;&#x3D;m;</em></li>
<li><em>a+b&#x3D;k*b*gcd(a,b)</em></li>
</ol>
<p>首先证明 <em>a</em> 一定是 <em>b</em> 的倍数：<br>证明：<br>因为 <em>a+b&#x3D;k*b*gcd(a,b)</em> , <em>a+b</em>是<em>b*gcd(a,b)</em> 的倍数, <em>a</em> 是 <em>b</em> 的 <em>(gcd(a,b)-1)</em> 倍,又因为 <em>a&gt;&#x3D;1,b&gt;&#x3D;1</em> ,所以 <em>gcd(a,b)-1!&#x3D;0</em> 。<br>因为 <em>a</em> 是 <em>b</em> 的 <em>(gcd(a,b)-1)</em> 倍且 <em>(gcd(a,b)-1)</em> 为自然数,所以 <em>a</em> 一定是 <em>b</em> 的倍数。<br>证明完毕。<br>最后总结出公式： <em>a+b&#x3D;k*b<sup>2</sup></em>,即 <em>(a+b)%(b*b)&#x3D;&#x3D;0</em> ,这道题就迎刃而解了。<br>警告：循环一定要开<em>long long</em>！！！  </p>
<figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> T,n,m,ans; </span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">	ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="number">0</span>); <span class="comment">//快读快写</span></span><br><span class="line">	cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">	cin &gt;&gt; T;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">while</span>(T--)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		ans=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">		cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; m;</span><br><span class="line">		<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=m;i++)&#123; <span class="comment">//b</span></span><br><span class="line">			<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> j=i;j&lt;=n;j+=i)&#123; <span class="comment">//a是b的倍数,j+=i</span></span><br><span class="line">				<span class="keyword">if</span>((i+j)%(i*i)==<span class="number">0</span>) ans++; <span class="comment">//利用总结出来的公式</span></span><br><span class="line">			&#125;</span><br><span class="line">		&#125;</span><br><span class="line">		cout &lt;&lt; ans &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>; <span class="comment">//输出</span></span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T2-矩阵行列交换"><a href="#T2-矩阵行列交换" class="headerlink" title="T2 矩阵行列交换"></a>T2 矩阵行列交换</h3><p><a href="https://newoj.daimayuan.top/p/5299?tid=6a6dd8a13beb8b91ff8fd43b">原题链接</a><br>分析：  </p>
