    <title>6-洛谷入门赛#51赛后总结</title>
    <url>/2026/08/25/6-%E6%B4%9B%E8%B0%B7%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E8%B5%9B51%E8%B5%9B%E5%90%8E%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="洛谷入门赛-51-LGR-300-Div-4-赛后总结"><a href="#洛谷入门赛-51-LGR-300-Div-4-赛后总结" class="headerlink" title="洛谷入门赛#51[LGR-300-Div.4]赛后总结"></a>洛谷入门赛#51[LGR-300-Div.4]赛后总结</h1><h2 id="比赛概述-难点分析："><a href="#比赛概述-难点分析：" class="headerlink" title="比赛概述+难点分析："></a>比赛概述+难点分析：</h2><ol>
<li>本场比赛共6道题，时长共2小时  </li>
<li>比赛为IOI赛制（比赛时可以看到分数和排名）  </li>
<li>T1,T2,T3较简单，其他较难，没做出来ToT  </li>
<li>官方公布难度（以洛谷题目难度为准）为”红橙橙橙黄绿”</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="题目分析"><a href="#题目分析" class="headerlink" title="题目分析"></a>题目分析</h2><h3 id="T1-千秋的西红柿里有多少果汁"><a href="#T1-千秋的西红柿里有多少果汁" class="headerlink" title="T1 千秋的西红柿里有多少果汁"></a>T1 千秋的西红柿里有多少果汁</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17308?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
<p>题目分析：本题考查基本数组和循环结构，没任何难度。  </p>
<h4 id="完整AC代码"><a href="#完整AC代码" class="headerlink" title="完整AC代码"></a>完整AC代码</h4><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> n,v[<span class="number">100005</span>],w[<span class="number">100005</span>],sumv,sumw;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> ans;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">	cin &gt;&gt; n;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=n;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		cin &gt;&gt; v[i];</span><br><span class="line">		sumv+=v[i];</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=n;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		cin &gt;&gt; w[i];</span><br><span class="line">		sumw+=w[i];</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	ans=<span class="number">1.0</span>*sumw/sumv;</span><br><span class="line">	cout &lt;&lt; fixed &lt;&lt; <span class="built_in">setprecision</span>(<span class="number">6</span>) &lt;&lt; ans;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T2-千秋的数学探究活动没有问题"><a href="#T2-千秋的数学探究活动没有问题" class="headerlink" title="T2 千秋的数学探究活动没有问题"></a>T2 千秋的数学探究活动没有问题</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17309?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
<p>题目分析：先将所有数的和算出来，在暴力枚举，再与最大值比较，注意最大值是字符串形式！！！最后输出最大值即可。  </p>
<h4 id="完整AC代码-1"><a href="#完整AC代码-1" class="headerlink" title="完整AC代码"></a>完整AC代码</h4><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> n,a[<span class="number">1000005</span>],k,sum;</span><br><span class="line">string s1,maxx;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">	ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">	cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">	cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; k;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=n;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span><br><span class="line">		sum+=a[i];</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	s1=<span class="built_in">to_string</span>(sum);</span><br><span class="line">	maxx=s1;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> len=s<span class="number">1.l</span>ength();</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">if</span>(k&gt;len)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		k=n;</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> l=<span class="number">1</span>;l&lt;=k;l++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">0</span>;i&lt;len-l<span class="number">+1</span>;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">			string tmp=s1;</span><br><span class="line">			<span class="built_in">reverse</span>(tmp.<span class="built_in">begin</span>()+i,tmp.<span class="built_in">begin</span>()+i+l);</span><br><span class="line">			<span class="keyword">if</span>(tmp&gt;maxx) maxx=tmp;</span><br><span class="line">		&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	cout &lt;&lt; maxx;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T3-千秋的进制转换应该比较快"><a href="#T3-千秋的进制转换应该比较快" class="headerlink" title="T3 千秋的进制转换应该比较快"></a>T3 千秋的进制转换应该比较快</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17310?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
<p>题目分析：这题考查最基础的进制转换，最基础的思路就是先将16进制字符串转成10进制整数，再转成2进制，但是注意字符串长度可能比较长，在16进制转10进制时常规方法会爆 <em>long long</em> ，强烈建议用bitset，能直接转为二进制，STL好用！  </p>
<h4 id="完整AC代码-2"><a href="#完整AC代码-2" class="headerlink" title="完整AC代码"></a>完整AC代码</h4><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> n;</span><br><span class="line">string s,ans;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">	cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; s;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">0</span>;i&lt;n;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">		<span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> m=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">		<span class="keyword">if</span>(s[i]&gt;=<span class="string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>&amp;&amp;s[i]&lt;=<span class="string">&#x27;9&#x27;</span>)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">			m=s[i]-<span class="string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">			ans+=<span class="built_in">bitset</span>&lt;<span class="number">4</span>&gt;(m).<span class="built_in">to_string</span>();</span><br><span class="line">		&#125;<span class="keyword">else</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">			m=s[i]-<span class="string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span><span class="number">+10</span>;</span><br><span class="line">			ans+=<span class="built_in">bitset</span>&lt;<span class="number">4</span>&gt;(m).<span class="built_in">to_string</span>();</span><br><span class="line">		&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	&#125;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">while</span>(ans[<span class="number">0</span>]==<span class="string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>&amp;&amp;ans.<span class="built_in">length</span>()&gt;<span class="number">1</span>) ans.<span class="built_in">erase</span>(<span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">1</span>);</span><br><span class="line">	cout &lt;&lt; ans;</span><br><span class="line">	<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T4-千秋的研究并不聚焦稀疏矩阵乘法"><a href="#T4-千秋的研究并不聚焦稀疏矩阵乘法" class="headerlink" title="T4 千秋的研究并不聚焦稀疏矩阵乘法"></a>T4 千秋的研究并不聚焦稀疏矩阵乘法</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17311?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
<p>题目分析：无  </p>
<h4 id="完整AC代码-3"><a href="#完整AC代码-3" class="headerlink" title="完整AC代码"></a>完整AC代码</h4><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T5-千秋的质数定义比较不一般"><a href="#T5-千秋的质数定义比较不一般" class="headerlink" title="T5 千秋的质数定义比较不一般"></a>T5 千秋的质数定义比较不一般</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17312?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
<p>题目分析：无  </p>
<h4 id="完整AC代码-4"><a href="#完整AC代码-4" class="headerlink" title="完整AC代码"></a>完整AC代码</h4><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h3 id="T6-千秋的键盘为什么如此奇怪"><a href="#T6-千秋的键盘为什么如此奇怪" class="headerlink" title="T6 千秋的键盘为什么如此奇怪"></a>T6 千秋的键盘为什么如此奇怪</h3><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P17313?contestId=350031">原题链接</a>  </p>
